# Legacy WordPress / WooCommerce / Zendesk URLs reported as 404 in Search Console.
# Only paths with a clear current equivalent are redirected; everything else keeps
# returning 404 on purpose so Google drops it from the index.
#
# Honoured by hosting layers that read Netlify-style _redirects. The same map is
# mirrored client-side in src/lib/legacyRedirects.ts so the SPA also handles them.

